WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750
Juri guards Ryu’s Drive Reversal after the opening jab.

2
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.750
Standing medium punch Punish Counters the recovery.

3
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.950
Heavy punch cancels into the gold OD heavy special.

4
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:05.500
Forward medium punch leads into the enhanced heavy, light and medium chain.

5
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.250
Forward medium punch links again after the enhanced chain.

6
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.300
Medium Fuhajin ends the punish and gains a stock.
